=== agr sync --help ===
Exit code: 0

--- stdout ---
Sync encrypted sessions to a remote (secret gists)

Usage: agr sync <COMMAND>

Commands:
  status   Show what push and pull would do, per session
  push     Upload new and changed sessions (encrypted)
  pull     Download new and changed sessions
  delete   Mark sessions deleted on the remote (encrypted bytes stay in the pack, the local file stays)
  migrate  Move the per-session gists of the old layout into packs
  key      Export or import the sync key
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

